# =============================================================================
# Project : Project 6 - Python (FastAPI) App CI/CD on Google GKE
# Author  : Sanjay Naidu
# File    : .dockerignore - keep the build context small and secret-free
# =============================================================================
# Allow-list style: ignore everything, then re-include only what the
# Dockerfile COPYs. A stray .env or key file can never end up in an image.
*
!app/pyproject.toml
!app/uv.lock
!app/src/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
